  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Michael Cannon-Brookes (born 17 November 1979) is an Australian billionaire and businessman who is the co-founder and chief executive officer of the software company Atlassian, a Forbes Global 2000 company.\nSince 2018, he has been involved in the Australia-Asia Power Link, a huge electricity infrastructure project to be developed in the Northern Territory by Sun Cable in a collaboration with the businessman Twiggy Forrest.",
    "sourceId": "wikipedia-en",
